---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Areas We Service | Stone Sealing Melbourne & Mornington Peninsula | Spickle"
  description="Spickle cleans and seals stone across 115 suburbs: Melbourne's inner and south-east suburbs and the Mornington Peninsula, from Abbotsford to Sorrento."
>
  <section class="band hairline-top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Where we work</h1>
      <p class="lede">115 suburbs: Melbourne's inner and south-east suburbs and the Mornington Peninsula, from Abbotsford to Sorrento.</p>
      <div class="regions">
        <div>
          <h2>Inner Melbourne</h2>
          <div class="todo">[Inner Melbourne suburbs from the 115-suburb list on the current site's contact page]</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>South-east suburbs</h2>
          <div class="todo">[South-east suburbs from the same list]</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Mornington Peninsula</h2>
          <div class="todo">[Peninsula suburbs from the same list]</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="rural">Outside these areas, we still travel. Rural jobs carry a separate travel fee, quoted up front, so you'll know the full price before you book.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band panel">
    <div class="wrap book-row">
      <div>
        <h2>In the area?</h2>
        <p>Send photos and a rough size and we'll price your job.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/book-now">Book a quote</a>
        <a class="tlink" href="tel:1300220045">Call 1300 22 00 45</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede { font-size: var(--step-1); color: #d6e8ee; margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); max-width: 40ch; }
  .regions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.75rem); }
  .regions h2 { font-size: var(--step-1); }
  .rural { margin-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); padding-top: 1.4rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .book-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem 3rem; }
  .book-row h2 { margin-bottom: 0.3em; }
  .book-row p { margin: 0; }
  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.9rem 1.6rem; }
</style>
